</TD></TR><TR><TD>
<DIV ALIGN="right">Mooppy<FONT COLOR="#FF0000">(01/5/11 14:02)</FONT></DIV>
<P>
<!--(207.46.71.13)-->誰も観ていないかもしれないけど。<BR><BR><A HREF="http://everquest.station.sony.com/">http://everquest.station.sony.com/</A> のtopの所に、<BR><BR>:=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=<BR> Guild Maintenance Coming May 15  <BR>:=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=<BR>On May 15th we will be performing another servers-wide guild wipe for any guild with less than ten members. Remember, it is always a requirement to have ten members in your guild. These ten members must all be characters from separate accounts (only one member from each account will be counted for the ten member total). <BR><BR>So if your guild does not have ten members on Tuesday, May 15th, it will be deleted. <BR><BR>We're sorry for being so harsh about this rule, but there is a distinct limit to the number of guilds that we can support, and the rules for maintenance of a guild are clear.  <BR><BR>--------------------------------<BR><BR>って、ことはGuild BANDITs消えちゃうかな?<BR><BR>
